### ========================================
### UNIFIED REGISTER & LOGIN
### ========================================
### The API uses /auth/register and /auth/login for all roles
### Specify role_id: 1=admin, 2=staff (customer uses OTP)

### Register Admin
# @name registerAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testadmin001",
  "password": "Admin@123456",
  "email": "testadmin@pharmacy.com",
  "full_name": "Test Admin User",
  "role_id": 1
}

### Register Staff
# @name registerStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "teststaff001",
  "password": "Staff@123456",
  "email": "teststaff@pharmacy.com",
  "full_name": "Test Staff User",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "role_id": 2,
  "branch_id": 1
}

### Login (Any Role)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin123",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 📝 After login: Copy the accessToken from response above
### and paste it into the @accessToken variable at the top of this file

### ========================================
### TOKEN MANAGEMENT
### ========================================

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ========================================
### PROFILE & PASSWORD (Protected Routes)
### ========================================

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Change Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "oldPassword": "Admin@123456",
  "newPassword": "Admin@654321"
}

### ========================================
### OTP LOGIN (CUSTOMER ONLY)
### ========================================

### Request OTP for Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "phone": "0987654321"
}

### Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Customer Login with OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/customer/login-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "otp": "123456"
}
